  dialogue:
  - sentence: '!!'
    cutsceneImage: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ead14e02511583a47bb1b9c64c945f3c, type: 3}
    methodCall:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    disableTextSpecificDelays: 1
    willBeInterupted: 0
    noFadeInTransition: 0
  - sentence: I think one of the keys I carried fell off.
    cutsceneImage: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
    methodCall:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    disableTextSpecificDelays: 0
    willBeInterupted: 0
    noFadeInTransition: 0
  - sentence: Oh...?
    cutsceneImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 841a2d43033e7184f8f2499d39c312f4, type: 3}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
    methodCall:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    disableTextSpecificDelays: 1
    willBeInterupted: 0
    noFadeInTransition: 0
  - sentence: The key... broke?
    cutsceneImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 841a2d43033e7184f8f2499d39c312f4, type: 3}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
    methodCall:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    disableTextSpecificDelays: 0
    willBeInterupted: 0
    noFadeInTransition: 0
  - sentence: Or maybe...
    cutsceneImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 841a2d43033e7184f8f2499d39c312f4, type: 3}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
    methodCall:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    disableTextSpecificDelays: 1
    willBeInterupted: 0
    noFadeInTransition: 0
  - sentence: I then checked each of the keys I was carrying.
    cutsceneImage: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
    methodCall:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    disableTextSpecificDelays: 1
    willBeInterupted: 0
    noFadeInTransition: 0
  - sentence: Just as I thought, all of the colored tips turned out to be removable.
